scotty (0.1.0~beta1-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep the laptop discoverable: re-assert the receive advertisement every 5
    minutes while receiving. Some BLE chipsets (e.g. MT7925) silently stop
    emitting the advert while the stack still thinks it is advertising, so the
    phone could no longer find the laptop until a manual visibility toggle.
    Skips during an active transfer and while set to "No one".

 -- Scotty Developers <scottydev40@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 15:30:00 -0500

scotty (0.1.0~beta1-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hide the share QR code. Quick Share's QR is a Google server-relay (files
    are uploaded to Google and the QR points at a Google-hosted download page);
    the engine only exposes the upstream placeholder URL, so the code resolved
    to nothing and a scanning phone stalled. Hidden until a real relay exists.

 -- Scotty Developers <scottydev40@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 09:50:00 -0500

scotty (0.1.0~beta1-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sanitize the peer device name before using it as the incoming-transfer
    destination folder (picked up from upstream google/nearby), so a peer
    cannot use path separators or "../" in its name to escape the save
    directory. Vendors internal/base/file_path_sanitize.

