scotty (0.1.0~beta1-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Consume the desktop startup token (xdg-activation / startup-id) passed to
    org.freedesktop.Application, so GNOME's launch spinner cursor clears when
    the window appears instead of spinning to its timeout.

