scotty (0.1.0~beta1-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the window never appearing from a --background launch (D-Bus activation,
    autostart): the root window's visible state was a QML binding that, on
    Wayland, blocked the C++ show path from mapping a window that started
    hidden. Clicking the launcher now surfaces the window.

 -- Scotty Developers <scottydev40@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 09:10:00 -0500

scotty (0.1.0~beta1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add maintainer scripts so removal behaves like a desktop uninstall: prerm
    stops the running app (per-user systemd unit, then a normal SIGTERM so
    Scotty's own shutdown and Wi-Fi restore can run) before its files are
    removed; postrm on purge wipes the core's per-user data (cached
    certificates, log, QML cache, Nearby preferences). Only core paths are
    touched and the shared "Google Nearby" dir is removed only when empty, so
    an installed scotty-mydevices plugin's credentials survive.

 -- Scotty Developers <scottydev40@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:42:00 -0500

